╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: OpenAIModel (Responses, TypeScript) sends invalid assistant history shape, rejected by Bedrock Mantle                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ### SDK Language                                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ TypeScript                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Steps to Reproduce                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The OpenAI Responses adapter serializes assistant history into an invalid `input` item shape when replaying multi-turn conversations without    │
│ server-side state (`stateful: false`).                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ For a two-turn conversation, `formatResponsesMessages` in `strands-ts/src/models/openai/responses-adapter.ts` emits the assistant turn as:      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```json                                                                                                                                         │
│ { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "output_text", "text": "..." }] }                                                                  │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ This matches neither valid OpenAI `input` shape for an assistant turn:                                                                          │
│ - `EasyInputMessage` (string content): `{ "role": "assistant", "content": "..." }`                                                              │
│ - `ResponseOutputMessage` (full item): requires `type: "message"`, `id`, `status`, and `output_text` with `annotations`.                        │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The emitted object is a bare `{ role, content:  }` missing all the `ResponseOutputMessage` required fields, so it is not a valid input item.    │
│ The code cast it away with `as unknown as ResponseInputItem`, and its own comment acknowledged the shape was incomplete.                        │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Reproduce with the Bedrock Mantle integ test `test/integ/models/openai/mantle.test.node.ts > handles reasoning content across multi-turn        │
│ conversations` (requires live Bedrock Mantle credentials).                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Expected Behavior                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Text-only assistant history is serialized as a valid, OpenAI-documented shape and accepted by both OpenAI-hosted and Bedrock Mantle.            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Actual Behavior                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Bedrock Mantle's strict Responses schema rejects the request:                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│ SubmitRequestFailure: code=-32602, msg=220 validation errors for ResponsesRequest                                                               │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ OpenAI-hosted tolerates the malformed shape (fills in / ignores the missing fields), so the bug was invisible there. It only surfaced once PR   │
│ #3290 made terminal `response.failed` stream events throw instead of finalizing as an empty successful response, which turned the               │
│ previously-swallowed Mantle rejection into a loud failure.                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Possible Solution                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ N/A                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Related Issues                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The Python SDK has the identical bug at `strands-py/src/strands/models/openai_responses.py` (`_format_request_message_content` emits            │
│ `output_text` for assistant text); fix both for parity.                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Surfaced by #3290.                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
